  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development and humanitarian aid-study visit</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Rozvojov&#xe1; a humanit&#xe1;rna pomoc-&#x161;tudijn&#xe1; n&#xe1;v&#x161;teva</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;V d&#x148;och 27.-30. okt&#xf3;bra 2013 nav&#x161;t&#xed;vila SR v r&#xe1;mci programu CETIR 6-&#x10d;lenn&#xe1; deleg&#xe1;cia Maced&#xf3;nskej republiky v nasleduj&#xfa;com zlo&#x17e;en&#xed;:&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;P&#xe1;n &lt;b&gt;Krum Efremov&lt;/b&gt;, State Counsellor at the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of&#xa0;the Republic of Macedonia &lt;br /&gt;Pani &lt;b&gt;Nona Shishkovska Sokolovska&lt;/b&gt;, assistant manager at the Ministry of Economy of&#xa0;the Republic of Macedonia &lt;br /&gt;P&#xe1;n &lt;b&gt;Sashko Nakovski&lt;/b&gt;, Ministry of Foreign Affairs of&#xa0;the Republic of Macedonia&lt;br /&gt;Pani &lt;b&gt;Mimoza Halili&lt;/b&gt;, Ministry of Foreign Affairs of&#xa0;the Republic of Macedonia&lt;br /&gt;Pani &lt;b&gt;Renata Petreska&lt;/b&gt;, Ministry of Foreign Affairs of&#xa0; the Republic of Macedonia&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Pani &lt;b&gt;Sanja Klikovska&lt;/b&gt;, Ministry of Finance of the Republic of Macedonia&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;From October&#xa0;27 through 30, 2013,&#xa0;6-member delegation from the Republic of Macedonia visited Slovakia in the following composition: &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Mr. Krum Efremov, State Counsellor at the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Republic of Macedonia &lt;br /&gt;Ms. Nona Shishkovska Sokolov, assistant manager at the Ministry of Economy of the Republic of Macedonia &lt;br /&gt;Mr. Sashko Nakovski, Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Republic of Macedonia &lt;br /&gt;Mrs. Mimoza Halili, Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Republic of Macedonia&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Ms. Renata Petreski, Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Republic of Macedonia &lt;br /&gt;Ms. Sanja Klikovska, Ministry of Finance of the Republic of Macedonia&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
